<title>USA: Sioux City hogs off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was moderate.</p>
<p>Compared with Wednesday, barrows and gilts were $0.50 lower.</p>
<p>Top $49.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3   220-270 lbs     49.00</p>
<p>		 270-280 lbs     48.50-49.00</p>
<p>    US 2-3   280-300 lbs     46.50-48.00</p>
<p>    US 3-4   300-330 lbs     45.00-46.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/off $1.00. Top $52.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3     300-400 lbs     42.00</p>
<p>		   400-450 lbs     scarce</p>
<p>		   450-500 lbs     45.00</p>
<p>		   500-550 lbs     50.00</p>
<p>		   550-700 lbs     52.00</p>
</text>
